  "content": "<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>这个资源包有什么作用？</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">这是一个非常简单的资源包，通过核心着色器<strong>移除雾气效果</strong>。它同样适用于某些模组添加的雾气。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">（包括失明与黑暗效果产生的雾气、地平线雾气、水下雾气以及洞穴雾气）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">仅支持可修改核心着色器的Minecraft版本。</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>如何使用？</strong></span></h3><p>这是简单的资源包，只需将ZIP文件复制到<strong>.minecraft/resourcepacks/</strong>路径即可。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>游戏内效果：</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>失明效果</strong>雾气对比：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/283/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"313\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>黑暗效果</strong>雾气对比：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/284/2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"314\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>水下</strong>雾气对比：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/286/3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"313\"></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">版本1.1更新内容</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>修复的问题：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">发光纹理渲染</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">闪电渲染</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">附魔光效渲染</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">……</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">注意事项：</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#e03e2d\">本资源包与<strong>Sodium</strong>等修改原版着色器的模组不兼容。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
